  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e70547d8134d5943ac3fafcae79c9dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ricky'sTroubles
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: Chase
  description: 'You chase after the crook, who runs into the crowded bazzar. He jumps
    on a horse and starts riding deeper into the city. Ricky takes a nearby charriot
    and call you to help him. The chase is fast and bumpy, still you manage to stay
    on the crooks tail the whole time. You get close enough to him to act. '
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: (Abdul) Use amethyst
    outcomeText: Abdul activates his amethyst and uses the shockwave it creates to
      proppel the charriot forward at an incredible speed. This manouver makes it
      so you catch up to the thief in no time, and jump him. You take Ricky's possesions
      back. After this Ricky thanks you and as a reward takes you to ALESSI.
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: (Sicur) Use misty step
    outcomeText: 'Sicur warps to the crook''s horse tackling him to the ground. You
      all jump him and take Ricky''s possesions back. After this Ricky thanks you
      and as a reward takes you to ALESSI. '
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
  - choiceText: (Zavren) Use ice magic
    outcomeText: Zavren uses his ice magic to freeze the ground in front of the 
      horse, making it slip and drop the thief to the ground. You all jump him and
      take Ricky's possesions back. After this Ricky thanks you and as a reward takes
      you to ALESSI.
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
